{
  "passageNumber": 38,
  "title": "Robots in Future Life",
  "units": [
    "第一单元 开始",
    "第二单元 发展",
    "第三单元 结尾"
  ],
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "assets/images/00.png",
      "en": "Robots in Future Life",
      "cn": "第 38 篇",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/01.png",
      "en": "Teacher: Would you like robots to be important in your life in the future?",
      "cn": "老师：你们希望机器人在未来生活中变得重要吗？",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/02.png",
      "en": "Jessica: To be honest, I think it is great.",
      "cn": "杰西卡：说实话，我认为这很棒。",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/03.png",
      "en": "A robot can do all the housework in my home.",
      "cn": "机器人可以做我家里所有的家务。",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/04.png",
      "en": "It can help with the chores I don't like, like washing dishes and cleaning my room.",
      "cn": "它可以帮忙做我不喜欢的杂务，比如洗碗和打扫房间。",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/05.png",
      "en": "Steve: If robots look like humans, that would be scary.",
      "cn": "史蒂夫：如果机器人看起来像人类，那会很可怕。",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/06.png",
      "en": "Nobody can tell they're robots or humans.",
      "cn": "没人能分辨它们是机器人还是人类。",
      "unit": 2
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/07.png",
      "en": "It would feel like a strange movie from the future.",
      "cn": "那会感觉像一部来自未来的奇怪电影。",
      "unit": 2
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/08.png",
      "en": "Kim: We just need to learn how to use this new technology.",
      "cn": "金：我们只需要学习如何使用这项新技术。",
      "unit": 2
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/09.png",
      "en": "Soon, we will feel like we can't live without them because they are so helpful.",
      "cn": "很快，我们会觉得没有它们就无法生活，因为它们太有用了。",
      "unit": 2
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/10.png",
      "en": "Mahmoud: I heard that robots can go to school for you and even do your homework!",
      "cn": "马哈茂德：我听说机器人可以替你去上学，甚至替你做作业！",
      "unit": 2
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/11.png",
      "en": "Roberta: I saw it on the website.",
      "cn": "罗伯塔：我在网站上看到的。",
      "unit": 3
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/12.png",
      "en": "Rebecca: Maybe robots will seem like real workers.",
      "cn": "丽贝卡：也许机器人会看起来像真正的工人。",
      "unit": 3
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/13.png",
      "en": "Then it's OK if people don't want to work anymore.",
      "cn": "那么，如果人们不想再工作也没关系。",
      "unit": 3
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/14.png",
      "en": "Some people think the robots are their friends, because they see robots as future workers.",
      "cn": "有些人认为机器人是他们的朋友，因为他们把机器人看作未来的工人。",
      "unit": 3
    }
  ],
